  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance (TA), to independent provider for capacity building.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The technical assistance component will mainly focus on maximize the impact of the financial aid by boosting efficiency, effectiveness, and results, particularly of the teacher development and school leadership components, provide specific interventions and support to reach marginalized children, especially girls, who may not be reached by government interventions under our financial aid investment and filling the gaps for interventions that are not well covered in ETOL or STEP where the UK has a comparative advantage (English Language).</narrative>
  </description>
